# Files excluded from the Docker build context (Slice 10b).
#
# Two jobs: keep the image small, and keep secrets and host-specific state out of a
# layer that gets pushed to a registry. Anything listed here is unreachable from the
# Dockerfile's `COPY . .`, so removing a line is not free — check what depends on it.
#
# Wording note: Tailwind v4 scans this repo as plain text, and a comment containing a
# word that is also a utility name emits a real CSS rule. An earlier draft of the line
# above did exactly that. See the Tailwind section of CLAUDE.md.

# Git metadata. Large, and its packed objects contain every version of every file
# ever committed, which is not something to ship inside a running container.
.git
.github
.gitignore

# Secrets and host-specific config. config/master.key is gitignored so it is not here
# today, but if it is ever generated locally it must NOT be baked into the image —
# RAILS_MASTER_KEY is a runtime environment secret, injected by Coolify.
config/master.key
config/credentials/*.key
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Runtime state that belongs to the host, not the image. Copying a local tmp/pids
# would ship a stale Puma pidfile and the container would refuse to boot.
/log/*
/tmp/*
/storage/*
!/log/.keep
!/tmp/.keep
!/storage/.keep

# Build outputs. Both are regenerated by `assets:precompile` in the build stage;
# copying a local build risks shipping assets that do not match this commit.
/public/assets
/public/packs
/public/packs-test
/app/assets/builds/*
!/app/assets/builds/.keep

# Bundler's local config — may point BUNDLE_PATH at a host directory and override the
# image's own settings.
/.bundle
/vendor/bundle

# Not needed at runtime. The test suite and its fixtures, the design-system mirror and
# plans, and the JS toolchain this app deliberately does not use (Hotwire over
# importmap — no Node, no build step).
/spec
/docs
/node_modules
/yarn-error.log
yarn-debug.log*
.yarn
.yarnrc
.yarn-integrity

# Dead deploy tooling and local-only developer scaffolding.
/.kamal
/.gstack
/.cc-shim
.mise-build-env.sh

.DS_Store
.byebug_history
